{
	"name": "Battle Censer",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/sundries/lights/lantern-iron-yellow.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>This heavy steel censer on a sturdy chain is usually used as an off-hand weapon. When you finish a long or short rest, you can spend 5 points from your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.my42mip0qc35rcp2]{Lay on Hands} pool or a 1st-level spell slot to imbue it with sacred energy. If you do, you are lightly obscured by a cloud of incense while wielding it, and it deals an additional 1d4 points of fire damage on a hit. Both effects last until you begin a rest. You can also spend 5 points from Lay on Hands as a bonus action to heavily obscure your space until the start of your next turn. </p>",
